# The Three Kingdoms San d'Oria in Chateau d'Oraguille, ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1, neither Halver's spell nor his cipher.
# Status 0: Halver says HALVER_OFFSET + 279 (no event). Status 3: 502 with parameter 7 = 1; its finish gives Halver's
# cipher and sets status 4; Halver then says HALVER_OFFSET + 279 again.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/502 GhelsbaOutpost/Warchief_Vatgit/onMobDeath NorthernSanDoria/Kasaroro/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/550
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=2,0.1,0.1 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdomsSandoria current
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
login
trigger Halver                          # status 0: a message
finish-if-event
missionstatus Windurst 3
trigger Halver                          # 502
finish                                  # status 4
trigger Halver                          # a message
finish-if-event
